Dialogue: 99,0:01:20.94,0:01:21.64,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:30.60,0:01:31.72,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:53.07,0:01:55.80,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Go to Tokyo, Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.81,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Your destiny awaits you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.90,0:02:34.21,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.88,0:02:38.23,Dialogue,Echo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mother!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.70,0:03:08.67,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where am I?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:11.07,0:03:13.73,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:43.25,0:03:45.70,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is that Earth?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:07.41,0:04:08.85,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:13.43,0:04:15.80,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two Kamuis?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:10.80,0:05:15.81,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I did it, Mother. I came back to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:28.06,0:05:29.89,Dialogue,Hinoto/Kanoe,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui has returned.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:43.55,0:06:45.26,Dialogue,Subaru,0,0,0,,Kamui has returned.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:45.69,0:06:50.51,Dialogue,Seishirou,0,0,0,,Indeed. For the final battle, \Nwhere Earth hangs in the balance.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:07.76,0:07:12.29,Dialogue,Seishirou,0,0,0,,A magnificent Barrier Field, as I'd expect\N from the leader of the Sumeragi clan.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.65,0:07:16.20,Dialogue,Subaru,0,0,0,,I mustn't inconvenience \Nthe people around us.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.20,0:07:19.63,Dialogue,Subaru,0,0,0,,My only objective is to kill you.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.34,0:07:58.21,Dialogue,Seishirou,0,0,0,,As you are a Dragon of Heaven \Nand I am a Dragon of Earth,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:58.72,0:08:02.42,Dialogue,Seishirou,0,0,0,,perhaps our killing each other \Nwas fated from the beginning.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:30.17,0:10:31.17,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:34.42,0:10:38.16,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,{\i1}So the final battle \Nhas begun at last, has it?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:44.58,0:10:48.17,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,You know what? I had a dream\Nabout Kamui last night!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:48.62,0:10:50.71,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him\Nsince he left six years ago,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:50.71,0:10:52.99,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,so there's no way I'd recognize him now,
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.99,0:10:56.25,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,but it was really him! \NAll grown up and everything!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:57.54,0:10:59.74,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,And there were two of him!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.35,0:11:02.84,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,It was such a strange dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.84,0:11:06.69,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?\N Come on, Big Brother!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.34,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Hmm? Did you say something?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.71,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Is something wrong? You're spaced out.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.16,0:11:14.95,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:17.95,0:11:21.23,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,It's late. I'll go cut\Nthe lights at the shrine.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:23.69,0:11:25.12,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'll help.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.94,0:11:45.52,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,It's been six years now, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:45.52,0:11:46.21,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:46.82,0:11:48.49,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Since Kamui left.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:50.26,0:11:52.08,Dialogue,Young Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.00,Dialogue,Young Fuma/Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:54.00,0:11:55.85,Dialogue,Young Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:55.85,0:11:57.86,Dialogue,Young Fuma/Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not yet!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:57.86,0:11:59.61,Dialogue,Young Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you ready?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:59.96,0:12:01.62,Dialogue,Young Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm ready!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.62,Dialogue,Young Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm ready!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:18.94,0:12:21.64,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Are you all right? \NYou're white as a sheet.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.19,0:12:23.05,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.19,0:13:24.16,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,What happened, Satsuki?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:31.95,0:13:33.67,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It is Kamui, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:35.46,0:13:39.67,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,My computers tell me that it's him.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.65,0:13:46.78,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The final battle is at last upon us...\N with Earth hanging in the balance.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:01.92,0:14:03.41,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:16.51,0:14:18.50,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui, is that you?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:31.36,0:14:32.52,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:11.15,0:16:12.03,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.55,0:16:18.04,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:18.94,0:16:22.20,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yours is the foreordained name
Dialogue: 99,0:16:22.20,0:16:24.55,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}of the one who holds \NEarth's fate in his hands.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:24.86,0:16:27.55,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,"Earth's fate"?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.71,0:16:31.74,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I beg you, please save Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.81,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:17.48,0:17:18.77,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.00,0:17:21.17,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Tokyo?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.73,0:17:25.82,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You're telling me \Nthis ruined city is Tokyo?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:36.64,0:17:38.02,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:39.59,0:17:40.21,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.71,0:17:44.00,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}We are traversing a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:44.40,0:17:48.21,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}As dreamwalkers, we cannot \Ninterfere with the dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:50.72,0:17:55.89,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am Hinoto, a dreamseer \Nwho dreams of the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:55.89,0:17:57.11,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Dreamseer?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:57.11,0:17:59.63,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}My role is to glimpse\Nthe future in my dreams
Dialogue: 99,0:17:59.63,0:18:02.35,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}and relay what I have seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.48,0:18:09.73,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,So you're saying this \Nis Tokyo in the future?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:09.99,0:18:14.05,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want you to save Earth \Nso that this does not happen.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:15.15,0:18:17.24,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Save Earth?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.71,0:18:27.25,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:27.57,0:18:29.29,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}The usual Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:28.51,0:20:31.10,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,What were those dragons?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:31.55,0:20:33.44,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dragons of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:39.14,0:20:41.52,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seven dragons will awaken.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:43.44,0:20:50.12,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}They will rend Tokyo asunder, \Nalong with the rest of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.47,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}The only ones who can battle \Nthe Dragons of Earth
Dialogue: 99,0:21:00.47,0:21:02.10,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}and save our planet from destruction
Dialogue: 99,0:21:02.10,0:21:03.78,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}are the Dragons of Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:03.78,0:21:05.29,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Big Dipper?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:05.99,0:21:07.83,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Just seven people in the whole world
Dialogue: 99,0:21:08.17,0:21:11.58,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}can create the Barrier Fields\N to save Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.88,0:21:38.60,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui, do you know \Nthe origin of your name?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.60,0:21:43.07,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,My mother gave it to me. \NThere's nothing more to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:43.07,0:21:44.85,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}It means "god's might."
Dialogue: 99,0:21:44.85,0:21:48.32,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}In other words, it is the name of the one\N who wields power on behalf of a god.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.32,0:21:50.39,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,The power of a god?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.57,0:21:55.52,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I definitely don't have that.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.52,0:21:58.64,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,And more importantly, \NI'm not interested in saving Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:58.64,0:21:59.75,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:59.75,0:22:03.80,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I came back to Tokyo for my own reasons.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.13,0:22:05.80,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if you don't act, Tokyo will—
Dialogue: 99,0:22:06.05,0:22:07.89,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I don't care about Tokyo!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:08.97,0:22:11.40,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,The city isn't what I'm here to protect.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:11.78,0:22:13.09,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, Kamui...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:16.67,0:22:20.27,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please... Please save Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:21.90,0:22:22.80,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.82,0:22:31.68,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Big Brother! Big Brother Fuuma!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:37.55,0:22:38.62,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:39.37,0:22:40.33,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:48.22,0:22:49.38,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Princess Hinoto!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:51.85,0:22:53.86,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You okay, Princess?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:53.86,0:22:54.94,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Miss Hinoto?
Dialogue: 99,0:22:56.19,0:22:57.26,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,Kamui...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:57.26,0:22:59.65,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}is{\i0} Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:17.84,0:23:22.08,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Um... Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:25.15,0:23:26.11,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.97,0:23:33.11,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui! I'm so glad to see you again.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:34.99,0:23:36.40,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:36.40,0:23:38.12,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:41.15,0:23:42.17,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Welcome home.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:44.94,0:23:47.45,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,So Kamui's real, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.54,0:23:51.26,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,The whole "he who holds Earth's \Nfate in his hands" thing
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.26,0:23:54.95,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,was kind of too big to wrap \Nmy head around before.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:55.37,0:24:00.46,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,I hear you. I thought "Kamui" \Nwas something more abstract.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:01.14,0:24:05.12,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,Like a great power with no physical form?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:05.12,0:24:05.97,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:07.04,0:24:08.60,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}That boy is Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:09.32,0:24:13.09,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Only a human could possibly \Ndecide humanity's fate.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:14.27,0:24:16.93,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,My mother's dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:16.93,0:24:17.98,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Aunt Tohru?!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:20.33,0:24:24.66,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,This means all seven Dragons \Nof Heaven have assembled, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:24:25.56,0:24:27.00,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,We're one short.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:28.62,0:24:31.29,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Subaru, head of the Sumeragi clan,
Dialogue: 99,0:24:31.29,0:24:34.32,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}has already died in battle \Nwith a Dragon of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:34.32,0:24:35.50,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Does that mean...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:36.10,0:24:39.14,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}One of the Barrier Fields \Nprotecting Tokyo has fallen.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.31,0:24:43.57,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sorata Arisugawa of Mt. Kouya.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:44.14,0:24:46.56,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Arashi Kishu of Ise Shrine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:47.51,0:24:50.28,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuzuriha Nekoi of Mitsumine Shrine.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:50.28,0:24:53.51,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Karen Kasumi and Seiichiro Aoki.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:55.10,0:24:59.01,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry, before Kamui falls \Ninto the hands of the Dragons of Earth!
Dialogue: 99,0:25:06.40,0:25:08.02,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no stopping it now...
Dialogue: 99,0:25:10.14,0:25:14.16,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bitter war for Earth has begun.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:15.64,0:25:16.45,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Our promise?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:16.73,0:25:21.40,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Yeah. Remember what you told us\N right here the day you moved away?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:22.11,0:25:25.36,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,You promised you'd come back\N and protect Kotori.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:42.14,0:25:48.87,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,So I made a promise in exchange. \NIf you protected her, I'd protect you.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:50.11,0:25:52.96,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,You've returned to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:53.54,0:25:55.86,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to keep my word.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.18,0:26:00.16,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kamui, I'll be the one to protect you.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:08.67,0:26:10.86,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,The end of the world is coming.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:10.86,0:26:12.80,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,The end of the world?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:13.50,0:26:17.13,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Kamui, is there someone \Nyou want to protect?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:18.32,0:26:21.49,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Someone you want to protect, \Neven if it costs your life?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:21.96,0:26:23.82,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori and Fuuma.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:25.83,0:26:26.72,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:26.72,0:26:30.08,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,And you, Mother. \NI'll protect you no matter what.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:30.58,0:26:35.95,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, but my fate \Ndictates that I must die.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:36.98,0:26:37.91,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fate?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:38.94,0:26:41.78,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,A future that has already been decided.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:41.78,0:26:46.38,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,No way. There's no such thing \Nas a predetermined future.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:46.38,0:26:47.32,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Actually...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:50.43,0:26:53.17,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Only the strong can change the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:54.09,0:26:58.99,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,Become stronger, Kamui, so that \Nyou can protect Kotori and Fuuma.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:01.08,0:27:05.58,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,So that you can protect the \Nones you love with your power.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:07.83,0:27:08.82,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Rain?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:40.58,0:27:42.53,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma, take Kotori.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:46.12,0:27:47.73,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,My name is Nataku.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:48.12,0:27:50.20,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Is this rain your doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:27:51.00,0:27:52.23,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,It's mine.
Dialogue: 99,0:27:59.44,0:28:00.24,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 99,0:28:00.51,0:28:02.90,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,The name's Shougo Asagi.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:22.78,0:28:25.54,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,We've been instructed to escort you.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:26.63,0:28:28.06,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Escort me where?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:28.32,0:28:30.30,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,Come along, and you'll find out.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:32.00,0:28:33.82,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,And if I say no?
Dialogue: 99,0:28:43.24,0:28:44.24,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:44.92,0:28:48.11,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,My role is to escort you.
Dialogue: 99,0:28:50.28,0:28:51.39,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 99,0:28:54.36,0:28:55.95,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,So rebellious.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:45.22,0:29:49.92,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,You're good. But that was\N merely my way of saying hello.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:50.63,0:29:55.56,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,I'd prefer not to use violence, \Nbut you leave us no choice.
Dialogue: 99,0:29:55.82,0:30:00.74,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Come on, now.\N Two on one ain't exactly fair.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:06.28,0:30:08.58,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,No bullying Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:30:10.28,0:30:14.42,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,If you're going two against one,\N we'll make it five against two.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:19.26,0:30:22.72,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Nice and fair, right?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:23.68,0:30:25.43,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 99,0:30:25.43,0:30:28.18,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,The adult world is complicated.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:28.18,0:30:33.23,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm an adult \Nand I agree with Yuzuriha.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:37.51,0:30:38.50,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Sorata.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:39.67,0:30:43.74,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,We'll disturb the neighborhood like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:44.33,0:30:46.24,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,I know, I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:47.74,0:30:50.49,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You're so responsible, missie.
Dialogue: 99,0:30:50.90,0:30:52.00,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,"Missie"?
Dialogue: 99,0:31:32.71,0:31:36.03,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,Quite an extravagant Barrier Field.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:36.03,0:31:40.63,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,Granted, with a barrier up,\N we're in a separate dimension.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:41.78,0:31:45.63,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,Physical reality won't\N be harmed by our fight this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:47.53,0:31:51.27,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,But in the event the creator dies,
Dialogue: 99,0:31:51.27,0:31:57.39,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,the barrier falls, and the area\N will mirror the devastation.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:57.91,0:31:58.90,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Knowledgeable guy.
Dialogue: 99,0:31:59.31,0:32:01.14,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,Because I've seen it.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:01.14,0:32:05.90,Dialogue,Shougo,0,0,0,,I've witnessed a Dragon of Heaven die \Nand everything within his barrier crumble.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:29.67,0:32:31.84,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,That's a very flashy water trick.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:31.84,0:32:34.35,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,He'd be good competition for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:32:51.95,0:32:54.00,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Thanks, Inuki!
Dialogue: 99,0:32:59.50,0:33:03.25,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Listen, dude, we've got \Nbusiness with Kamui too.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:03.25,0:33:05.50,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,How about you withdraw \Npeacefully for today?
Dialogue: 99,0:33:13.51,0:33:14.80,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:23.84,0:33:26.23,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,On makeishibaraya sowaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:37.37,0:33:40.33,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Sucks for you about the weather.
Dialogue: 99,0:33:45.10,0:33:46.43,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Big Brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:33:51.90,0:33:54.30,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:33:58.97,0:34:00.60,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma! Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:12.16,0:34:13.93,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,What did you do to them?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:15.31,0:34:16.61,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:18.79,0:34:20.79,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:21.13,0:34:22.37,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:25.59,0:34:26.88,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Give them back!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:36.22,0:34:37.38,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:37.95,0:34:40.96,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hurts like hell, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:40.96,0:34:43.14,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Where'd the weirdos go?
Dialogue: 99,0:34:44.33,0:34:48.15,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,They appear to have fled,\N cowed by your power.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:49.66,0:34:51.04,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Yeah, go figure!
Dialogue: 99,0:34:51.04,0:34:52.15,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 99,0:34:53.54,0:34:57.23,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Man, this guy's strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:34:57.23,0:34:59.25,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,That's Kamui for you!
Dialogue: 99,0:35:01.21,0:35:02.66,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Wait, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:07.24,0:35:11.17,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,We aren't the ones who kidnapped them.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:16.92,0:35:19.18,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,I assume it was the Dragons of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:24.78,0:35:29.19,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Kamui, please come with us.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:42.63,0:35:47.06,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right this way, dear girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:35:59.78,0:36:06.75,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Beloved of Kamui, you are the \Nlovely flower that will lure him to us.
Dialogue: 99,0:36:52.23,0:36:57.99,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,{\i1}How? I didn't call him here. \NHow did he invade my dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:06.06,0:37:07.46,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Where is Kotori?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:10.22,0:37:12.75,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Where did you put her?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:18.19,0:37:21.77,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Hey! Can you hear me? Where's Kotori?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:22.12,0:37:23.85,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Where did you put her?
Dialogue: 99,0:37:25.35,0:37:28.68,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I've found the other Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:29.45,0:37:31.33,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Kamui's twin star.
Dialogue: 99,0:37:31.95,0:37:35.54,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The second Kamui,\N born to fill the empty seat
Dialogue: 99,0:37:35.54,0:37:39.58,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,no matter which dragon the first becomes.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:44.92,0:38:48.48,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tokyo... This is Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:49.16,0:38:55.65,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}But what am I doing up here?\N I was just at Togakushi Shrine.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:56.06,0:38:57.20,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,This is a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:38:57.20,0:38:58.02,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,A dream?
Dialogue: 99,0:38:58.02,0:39:02.17,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Yes. This is a dream.\N But it isn't {\i1}just{\i0} a dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:02.60,0:39:04.76,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,This dream shows the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:04.76,0:39:05.62,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,The future?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:06.96,0:39:11.41,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I am Kanoe, a dreamseer \Nwho dreams of the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:11.41,0:39:12.59,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Dreamseer?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:13.21,0:39:15.60,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,My role is to glimpse \Nthe future in my dreams
Dialogue: 99,0:39:15.60,0:39:17.97,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,and relay what I have seen.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:19.21,0:39:21.92,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,We are traversing such a dream right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:22.67,0:39:24.50,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,This is Tokyo in the future?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:24.87,0:39:27.85,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Yes. This is its beautiful \Nfuture appearance
Dialogue: 99,0:39:27.85,0:39:33.93,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,after the once stagnant and foul Tokyo\N is destroyed and reborn.
Dialogue: 99,0:39:35.10,0:39:38.13,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Why was the Metropolitan \NGovernment Office left standing?
Dialogue: 99,0:39:57.10,0:40:00.41,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It's all right. That dragon \Nis one of your compatriots.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:01.26,0:40:04.19,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,In fact, it may well be you.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:05.64,0:40:10.18,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The Dragons of Earth will destroy\NTokyo's barriers, ushering in its rebirth.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:10.91,0:40:11.81,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Dragons of Earth?
Dialogue: 99,0:40:31.83,0:40:35.83,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Tokyo is the crux of the barriers \Ndriven into Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:36.58,0:40:38.78,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,There are many of them here.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:39.99,0:40:42.90,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The enormous Barrier Stones \Nof the Shinjuku skyscrapers.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:43.48,0:40:46.01,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The Yamanote Line, centered \Naround the Imperial Palace,
Dialogue: 99,0:40:46.01,0:40:48.97,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,with tracks laid in the shape \Nof Buddha's hand to protect Tokyo.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:49.38,0:40:53.78,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sunshine 60, a foundation stone \Nsupporting unstable ground.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:54.17,0:40:57.84,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,And then... Tokyo Tower.
Dialogue: 99,0:40:59.78,0:41:03.48,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,If we destroy all the barriers, \NTokyo will crumble.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:04.22,0:41:07.08,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,All these harmful structures built by man
Dialogue: 99,0:41:07.08,0:41:10.03,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,and everything polluted \Nwill be lain waste.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:10.03,0:41:14.23,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Then the beautiful rebirth \Nof nature will come to pass.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:14.23,0:41:17.14,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Earth will regain its true form.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:17.56,0:41:20.69,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,But standing in the way of that \Nare the Dragons of Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:39.99,0:41:42.88,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,You hold the same power as Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:44.19,0:41:46.46,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,You are his twin star.
Dialogue: 99,0:41:47.20,0:41:50.46,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,When Kamui fully becomes \None dragon or the other,
Dialogue: 99,0:41:50.95,0:41:55.21,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,as his accompanying star, \Nyou will fill the remaining seat.
Dialogue: 99,0:42:09.40,0:42:10.81,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:18.31,0:42:19.94,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:19.94,0:42:21.06,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 99,0:42:30.82,0:42:31.82,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,0:42:37.28,0:42:41.25,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 99,0:42:56.00,0:43:01.21,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,This isn't real! This is a dream!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:02.65,0:43:06.73,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,It's just a dream!
Dialogue: 99,0:43:14.72,0:43:21.75,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Yes, this is just a dream. \NBut it's also the future.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:31.10,0:43:35.84,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It will die. At this rate, \NEarth will truly perish.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:36.59,0:43:42.91,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sullied and violated by humans, \Nit has lost the strength to be reborn.
Dialogue: 99,0:43:55.84,0:43:58.82,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,At this point, Earth cannot \Nbe reborn without destruction.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:01.58,0:44:04.46,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Save Earth with your power.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:05.56,0:44:07.88,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I'm just a high school student.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:07.88,0:44:12.59,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I don't have the power \Nto save or destroy the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:12.82,0:44:16.13,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,You do. It just hasn't awakened yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:24.97,0:44:28.28,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,She couldn't endure the dreamwalking.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:29.54,0:44:33.62,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It's all right. She's asleep \Ndeep within the dream,
Dialogue: 99,0:44:33.62,0:44:35.99,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,so she won't be killed by Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:36.58,0:44:37.54,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,By Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,0:44:37.54,0:44:39.03,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Yes, Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:39.68,0:44:43.64,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That is the name of he who hunts\Nthose who wield divine power.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:44.10,0:44:47.58,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It is the other Kamui... You.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:47.58,0:44:52.85,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Please, become a Dragon of Earth \Nand destroy all of Tokyo's barriers.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:53.54,0:44:56.35,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That is how you can save \Nyour precious sister.
Dialogue: 99,0:44:56.80,0:45:00.09,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,And Kamui too! I won't let him kill...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:01.72,0:45:02.72,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,anyone...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:04.33,0:45:05.61,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 99,0:45:08.65,0:45:10.33,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,is up to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:45:45.39,0:45:46.32,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:46:23.92,0:46:25.76,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:28.98,0:46:33.69,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I cannot speak, nor can I see or hear.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:34.63,0:46:38.69,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I beg your pardon \Nfor addressing you telepathically.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:40.88,0:46:41.80,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:48.58,0:46:49.70,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You, eh?
Dialogue: 99,0:46:50.18,0:46:54.75,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I apologize for rudely summoning you\N into my dream without warning.
Dialogue: 99,0:46:57.47,0:47:01.53,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,See, the princess's job \Nis to dream of the future
Dialogue: 99,0:47:01.53,0:47:04.11,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,and tell the politicians in the\NDiet Building what she sees.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:04.48,0:47:07.64,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Unfortunately, the final battle has begun.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:08.10,0:47:11.26,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please join those who have \Ngathered here with me
Dialogue: 99,0:47:11.26,0:47:15.10,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}and save Tokyo... No, all of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:15.61,0:47:19.57,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I already told you no. \NI came to Tokyo for—
Dialogue: 99,0:47:20.09,0:47:23.76,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}The boy and girl \Nfrom Togakushi Shrine, correct?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:26.70,0:47:27.94,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,What makes you think so?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:28.95,0:47:34.96,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I glimpsed those precious to you\N while dreamwalking with you.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:35.67,0:47:38.79,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}The two people you care about most.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:38.79,0:47:39.59,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,{\an8}Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:38.79,0:47:39.59,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:39.59,0:47:40.34,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:47:46.49,0:47:48.92,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Are you the one who \Nkidnapped Kotori and Fuuma?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:49.78,0:47:51.06,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}No.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:51.47,0:47:52.52,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Then who did?
Dialogue: 99,0:47:54.59,0:47:58.69,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe, my sister.
Dialogue: 99,0:47:58.69,0:47:59.74,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Your sister?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:02.60,0:48:04.06,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Explain.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:04.06,0:48:07.14,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe is my younger sister, \Nand my only family by blood.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:08.16,0:48:11.74,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}She inherited the same \Ndreamwalking powers I did.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:12.48,0:48:17.40,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe is gathering the Dragons of Earth,\Nwho would ruin the world.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:17.78,0:48:21.62,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Dragons of Earth? Like what you showed me?
Dialogue: 99,0:48:28.63,0:48:29.54,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take my hand.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:34.14,0:48:36.94,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will show you a future \Nthat involves you.
Dialogue: 99,0:48:52.36,0:48:56.04,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:49:40.87,0:49:45.61,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:01.64,0:50:03.19,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 99,0:50:03.19,0:50:05.69,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You're telling me \N{\i1}I'm{\i0} going to kill Kotori?
Dialogue: 99,0:50:06.08,0:50:10.19,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you become a Dragon of Heaven, \Nyou can change this future.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:11.46,0:50:13.09,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,That was a messed-up dream.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:17.66,0:50:21.03,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,I used to feel the same way.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:21.03,0:50:23.26,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,"Earth's future doesn't concern me."
Dialogue: 99,0:50:23.26,0:50:27.25,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,"It's just annoying when people talk \Nabout something so vague."
Dialogue: 99,0:50:30.57,0:50:33.83,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,I considered my power\N nothing more than a nuisance too.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:33.83,0:50:35.83,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,I didn't want to get involved with anyone,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:35.83,0:50:41.63,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,so I took pleasure-quarters jobs. \NHostess, "masseuse"...
Dialogue: 99,0:50:42.01,0:50:45.06,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,But the thing is, \NI love Tokyo the way it is.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:45.60,0:50:47.96,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,No one loves this city more than I do.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:51.60,0:50:56.39,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,My wife and daughter love Tokyo as well.
Dialogue: 99,0:50:56.39,0:50:58.56,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,So it may not sound like a big dream,
Dialogue: 99,0:50:58.56,0:51:03.50,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,but I want to live peacefully \Nhere with my family.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:06.66,0:51:08.38,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,How about it, Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,0:51:20.99,0:51:24.59,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Satsuki built this computer. \NIts name is Beast.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:24.59,0:51:28.33,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,She can infiltrate any network \Nfrom any terminal,
Dialogue: 99,0:51:28.33,0:51:31.42,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,instantaneously read its data,\N and control it.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:32.06,0:51:37.05,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,According to Satsuki, \Ncomputers love her deeply.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:37.76,0:51:40.02,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,They apparently get jealous
Dialogue: 99,0:51:40.02,0:51:42.46,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,if she transfers her \Naffections to anyone else.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:43.46,0:51:45.99,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Though I suppose\N we can say that's the realm
Dialogue: 99,0:51:45.99,0:51:49.09,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,of Earth's greatest hacker girl, \Nher computers, and their romance.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:52.50,0:51:54.05,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,You must be surprised.
Dialogue: 99,0:51:54.05,0:51:57.68,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,No one would expect to find this below\N the Metropolitan Government Office.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:21.05,0:52:25.01,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I call this beauty "Glass Tokyo."
Dialogue: 99,0:52:28.63,0:52:31.71,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I shall prove to you that my \Ndreamseeing is accurate.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:33.52,0:52:36.55,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Right here. This place... will crumble.
Dialogue: 99,0:52:38.95,0:52:40.05,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 99,0:52:40.58,0:52:44.06,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's Tokyo Station... It's about to fall!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:18.43,0:53:21.01,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm going to get a photo \Nwith all three of you. Line up!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:21.37,0:53:23.31,Dialogue,Young Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take a good picture, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:23.31,0:53:24.42,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:24.42,0:53:26.53,Dialogue,Young Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, don't do that!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:25.15,0:53:28.60,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}Boys, you don't all fit \Nin the frame if you do that.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:29.94,0:53:31.90,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't move, okay?
Dialogue: 99,0:53:32.18,0:53:34.15,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now say cheese!
Dialogue: 99,0:53:44.24,0:53:49.74,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}Become stronger, Kamui, so that \Nyou can protect Kotori and Fuuma.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:49.74,0:53:53.65,Dialogue,Tohru,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that you can protect the \Nones you love with your power.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:54.60,0:53:55.92,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,{\i1}Listen, Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:53:56.56,0:54:02.18,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,{\i1}You have power. How you use \Nthat power is up to you.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:15.92,0:54:17.71,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,Shall we be off?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:17.71,0:54:18.40,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Let's.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:19.54,0:54:20.58,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Yuzuriha.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:20.58,0:54:21.52,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:21.52,0:54:23.23,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,You stay here.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:23.23,0:54:23.70,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:54:24.07,0:54:28.70,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Should the worst happen to us, \Nlet Sorata and the others know.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:28.70,0:54:30.85,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I'll fight with you!
Dialogue: 99,0:54:30.85,0:54:37.26,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, Miss Hinoto \Nwill know without me reporting it.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:38.90,0:54:43.10,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,There are still plenty \Nof barriers that need protection.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:43.46,0:54:48.22,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,This time, just watch us work.
Dialogue: 99,0:54:51.46,0:54:56.01,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,And be sure to stay outside \Nof my Barrier Field.
Dialogue: 99,0:55:10.31,0:55:12.05,Dialogue,Salaryman,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:12.75,0:55:13.48,Dialogue,Salaryman,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:13.85,0:55:15.66,Dialogue,Salaryman,0,0,0,,Wait, please!
Dialogue: 99,0:55:16.75,0:55:17.71,Dialogue,Salaryman,0,0,0,,Hey! Wait!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:25.04,0:58:26.82,Dialogue,Karen,0,0,0,,Don't get too full of yourself!
Dialogue: 99,0:58:43.45,0:58:44.42,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Karen!
Dialogue: 99,0:59:11.13,0:59:12.68,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:14.19,0:59:15.69,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:24.00,0:59:25.33,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:27.07,0:59:28.21,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:37.64,0:59:39.08,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:42.48,0:59:44.00,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Something's here.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:44.75,0:59:52.00,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's... There's something inside me...
Dialogue: 99,0:59:52.63,0:59:54.25,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,0:59:55.52,1:00:00.60,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Inside me... something is growing.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:12.52,1:00:16.88,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Soon... It will be born soon...
Dialogue: 99,1:00:21.06,1:00:22.03,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:43.88,1:00:45.11,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Karen?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:45.11,1:00:45.91,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:47.31,1:00:49.58,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}What of Seiichiro Aoki?
Dialogue: 99,1:00:50.33,1:00:52.53,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I can't find him anywhere.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:53.36,1:00:57.30,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Meaning he went to another barrier.
Dialogue: 99,1:00:59.67,1:01:00.43,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Okay then!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:03.03,1:01:05.43,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,No! I'll fight with you!
Dialogue: 99,1:01:10.74,1:01:12.44,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui has returned.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:28.50,1:01:30.46,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It seems you have your Kamui now.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:31.76,1:01:32.74,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe...
Dialogue: 99,1:01:34.06,1:01:36.08,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Do you think that means you've won?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:37.55,1:01:39.63,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I've found a Kamui too.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:41.83,1:01:45.22,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Whether Kamui becomes \Na Dragon of Heaven or Earth,
Dialogue: 99,1:01:45.22,1:01:49.00,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,there will always be another Kamui\Nborn to fill the empty seat.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:49.00,1:01:50.31,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui's accompanying star?
Dialogue: 99,1:01:50.72,1:01:51.81,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:52.36,1:01:56.46,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,One of the precious people {\i1}your {\i0}\NKamui wanted to protect, sister dear.
Dialogue: 99,1:01:56.46,1:01:59.82,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That's why Kamui came back, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:01.21,1:02:03.65,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,How ironic that their fate \Nis to fall on opposite sides
Dialogue: 99,1:02:03.65,1:02:05.40,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,and try to kill each other.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:07.69,1:02:08.87,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}How cruel of you...
Dialogue: 99,1:02:09.17,1:02:11.49,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Cruel? You think {\i1}I'm{\i0} cruel?!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:11.85,1:02:13.78,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,It's not as though I wished for this!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:14.51,1:02:17.34,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,What's cruel is their fate.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:17.78,1:02:22.34,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe, stop using the Dragons of Earth\N to break the barriers.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:22.67,1:02:23.34,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:29.32,1:02:33.79,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I have every right you do\Nto wish for the future I desire.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:34.26,1:02:36.66,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your desire is to see Earth in ruins?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:36.66,1:02:37.63,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Earth?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:42.27,1:02:44.17,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I don't care about {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:46.27,1:02:47.29,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe!
Dialogue: 99,1:02:47.29,1:02:50.17,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sister, the fight is only just beginning.
Dialogue: 99,1:02:50.17,1:02:54.54,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Can your Kamui win against mine?
Dialogue: 99,1:02:56.65,1:02:59.94,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,To what end are we fighting like this?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:11.58,1:03:15.52,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,What is it that you Dragons of Earth {\i1}want{\i0}?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:16.35,1:03:19.46,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,It is not Earth we wish to destroy.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:19.99,1:03:21.03,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,It is humanity.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:21.74,1:03:24.02,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,Humans kill and hate each other.\NThey ruin the planet.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:24.02,1:03:26.74,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,You think there is value \Nin their existence?
Dialogue: 99,1:03:30.10,1:03:32.70,Dialogue,Nataku,0,0,0,,Earth desires silence.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:36.72,1:03:38.99,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You may be right about that.
Dialogue: 99,1:03:38.99,1:03:42.67,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I want to protect the people I love!
Dialogue: 99,1:03:43.52,1:03:49.04,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,{\i1}And to repay the kindness of my allies,\Nhowever short our time together...
Dialogue: 99,1:03:50.76,1:03:53.74,Dialogue,Aoki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't let you leave here alive!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:23.26,1:04:24.46,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Mr. Aoki!
Dialogue: 99,1:04:25.55,1:04:28.97,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,How many barriers do we have left?
Dialogue: 99,1:04:40.31,1:04:43.42,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Code 1095 from Beast.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:44.08,1:04:47.99,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}The Sunshine 60 barrier \Nhas been fully deactivated.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:47.99,1:04:51.22,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything within a five-kilometer \Nradius is in ruins.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:52.72,1:04:58.08,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Code 1096. Fatality: Dragon \Nof Heaven Seiichiro Aoki.
Dialogue: 99,1:04:58.08,1:05:00.50,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our side has lost Nataku.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:15.77,1:05:18.02,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,What a beautiful dawn.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:19.91,1:05:21.32,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,I suppose that was cliché.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:24.33,1:05:29.94,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am your accompanying star, Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:29.94,1:05:32.28,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}My fate is being decided.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:33.03,1:05:35.08,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's inside of Kotori...
Dialogue: 99,1:05:35.60,1:05:38.91,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}For my sake, she's...
Dialogue: 99,1:05:40.36,1:05:45.96,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Screw doing things for the sake \Nof the world or for Earth.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:45.96,1:05:48.97,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}I came home to protect \Nthe people important to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:48.97,1:05:51.97,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I'm going to fight for {\i0}them{\i1}.
Dialogue: 99,1:05:52.47,1:05:54.05,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,{\i1}Good enough, Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:02.47,1:06:03.36,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:06.08,1:06:07.90,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Look after Yuzuriha!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:13.45,1:06:15.33,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 99,1:06:44.39,1:06:46.00,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,You're a good dog.
Dialogue: 99,1:06:47.56,1:06:48.83,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:00.25,1:07:01.21,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:02.10,1:07:03.34,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,A Dragon of Earth...
Dialogue: 99,1:07:16.10,1:07:18.68,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Somethin' on my face, kid?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:21.79,1:07:22.84,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 99,1:07:24.43,1:07:27.69,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,You can see Inuki, can't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:27.94,1:07:28.96,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Inuki?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:30.33,1:07:31.71,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Funny name.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:32.10,1:07:36.70,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Only people involved in the \Nend of the world can see him.
Dialogue: 99,1:07:37.70,1:07:39.44,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,You're saying...?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:39.78,1:07:42.45,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,You're a Dragon of Earth, aren't you?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:43.15,1:07:44.46,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Dragons of Heaven, eh?
Dialogue: 99,1:07:44.76,1:07:46.93,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Please tell me! Is Kotori—
Dialogue: 99,1:08:10.12,1:08:12.39,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,That's Yuzuriha's Barrier Field.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:12.39,1:08:13.86,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Guess it's started.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:16.17,1:08:21.92,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,She's barely in junior high. \NProbably never even been in love.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:23.55,1:08:26.74,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,We should've left her with the princess.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:27.58,1:08:29.10,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,You're kind.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:31.10,1:08:32.64,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Let's be her backup.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:32.64,1:08:33.63,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Backup?
Dialogue: 99,1:08:35.04,1:08:35.80,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:08:56.75,1:08:59.28,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't he kinda remind you of Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:06.80,1:09:07.95,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,A Dragon of Earth?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:07.95,1:09:08.83,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:09.53,1:09:12.84,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,He's a weird one all right.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:13.14,1:09:15.88,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,His face looks nothing like Kamui's,\N but for some reason...
Dialogue: 99,1:09:35.72,1:09:40.09,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Not to worry. \NWhatever happens, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:41.38,1:09:44.95,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You're a hottie, so I like ya.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:44.95,1:09:47.29,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Would any hottie do?
Dialogue: 99,1:09:47.29,1:09:50.79,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Nope! I want to protect {\i1}you{\i0}, missie.
Dialogue: 99,1:09:52.17,1:09:56.80,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,People with someone to protect are \Nstrong, you know? Watch and see.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:43.45,1:10:44.69,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Yuto!
Dialogue: 99,1:10:44.69,1:10:47.01,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,How long are you planning on watching?
Dialogue: 99,1:10:49.36,1:10:54.05,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,My apologies. I wanted to see \Nwhat you can do, Kusanagi.
Dialogue: 99,1:10:54.42,1:10:57.19,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Dumbass. This ain't a military exercise.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:26.78,1:11:27.74,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 99,1:11:28.82,1:11:31.82,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Someone is using the cables for defense.
Dialogue: 99,1:11:31.82,1:11:33.73,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Very artistic.
Dialogue: 99,1:12:37.36,1:12:40.60,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,I was so entranced by your swordplay, \NI let my guard down.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:27.28,1:13:28.24,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Hey, dude!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:29.13,1:13:30.84,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You know Kamui, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:33.90,1:13:35.85,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,He's looking for you.
Dialogue: 99,1:13:36.89,1:13:37.88,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,1:13:40.31,1:13:42.86,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:13:47.27,1:13:48.18,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,F...
Dialogue: 99,1:13:49.79,1:13:50.91,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma...
Dialogue: 99,1:13:55.91,1:13:57.41,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:12.34,1:14:13.50,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Yuzuriha!
Dialogue: 99,1:14:19.08,1:14:21.05,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,It's all over now.
Dialogue: 99,1:14:31.48,1:14:35.62,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I wasn't helpful at all, was I?
Dialogue: 99,1:14:36.68,1:14:40.33,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I've never been in love, so...
Dialogue: 99,1:14:40.33,1:14:44.13,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,I wanted to fall in love before I died...
Dialogue: 99,1:14:54.80,1:14:59.84,Dialogue,Yuzuriha,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui! Protect the ones you \Nlove, okay? No matter what!
Dialogue: 99,1:16:54.66,1:16:56.98,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma! You're all right?!
Dialogue: 99,1:16:57.40,1:16:59.08,Dialogue,Kusanagi,0,0,0,,Leave him to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:07.20,1:17:08.19,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma?
Dialogue: 99,1:17:16.26,1:17:20.67,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I see you've chosen to be\N a Dragon of Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:22.11,1:17:24.26,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I am your accompanying star.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:24.78,1:17:30.21,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Your twin star, born for the moment \Nyou decide which dragon to become.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:32.73,1:17:33.71,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma...
Dialogue: 99,1:17:34.04,1:17:40.22,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,If you are a Dragon of Heaven, \Nthen my destiny is to kill you.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:40.78,1:17:42.11,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma...!
Dialogue: 99,1:17:43.62,1:17:46.32,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,This is fate, Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,1:17:49.89,1:17:50.77,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:18:04.49,1:18:05.57,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:07.83,1:18:13.68,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}How awful, to have to fight someone you \Nswore you'd give your all to protect...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:17.21,1:18:20.00,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Send me to where Kotori is.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:25.74,1:18:30.05,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Into your dream, where Kotori is sleeping.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:35.59,1:18:37.24,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:43.50,1:18:44.78,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,The time has come.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:45.11,1:18:47.70,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,The sword that can only be nurtured\N by someone who loves
Dialogue: 99,1:18:47.70,1:18:49.17,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,"Kamui" with all her heart...
Dialogue: 99,1:18:50.41,1:18:55.02,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,The first blade belongs \Nto Kamui, the Dragon of Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,1:18:56.23,1:19:02.01,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,And this one belongs\N to Kamui, the Dragon of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,1:19:05.77,1:19:07.05,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kotori...
Dialogue: 99,1:19:13.83,1:19:14.85,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:23.54,1:19:25.48,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kotori, run!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:36.35,1:19:37.21,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:39.78,1:19:41.87,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kotori, over here!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:48.51,1:19:49.84,Dialogue,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:19:54.03,1:19:54.85,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,1:20:02.92,1:20:03.69,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma...
Dialogue: 99,1:21:06.06,1:21:10.58,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:41.88,1:21:44.30,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 99,1:21:48.34,1:21:49.64,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,Yuto!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:52.28,1:21:53.69,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:53.69,1:21:56.87,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,Beast, save Yuto!
Dialogue: 99,1:21:56.87,1:22:00.83,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Why? Kusanagi and I \Nare both Dragons of Earth...
Dialogue: 99,1:22:00.83,1:22:02.94,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Why kill us?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:03.36,1:22:07.86,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Why? Whether you're Dragons of Earth \Nor Heaven is irrelevant to me.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:07.86,1:22:11.41,Dialogue,Satsuki,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Beast?! Save Yuto!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:16.32,1:22:18.58,Dialogue,Yuto,0,0,0,,Are you doing this to save Kamui?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:20.26,1:22:21.76,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I{\i0} am Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:22:53.13,1:22:54.72,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 99,1:22:54.72,1:22:56.95,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}That young man is also Kamui.
Dialogue: 99,1:22:58.41,1:23:01.20,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}A being who lives solely \Nfor destruction and carnage.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:01.82,1:23:03.39,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who lives only to kill
Dialogue: 99,1:23:03.39,1:23:07.61,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}the Dragons of Heaven \Nand destroy all of Tokyo's barriers.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:07.61,1:23:09.46,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}He is the Dragons of Earth's—
Dialogue: 99,1:23:28.41,1:23:30.36,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,All the Dragons of Earth have fallen.
Dialogue: 99,1:23:39.63,1:23:40.65,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:07.16,1:24:08.30,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe!
Dialogue: 99,1:24:15.23,1:24:16.64,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 99,1:24:28.76,1:24:35.98,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sister, you've spent your life here \Nunderground, dreaming for politicians,
Dialogue: 99,1:24:35.98,1:24:38.67,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,predicting the future.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:38.67,1:24:42.73,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,And you predicted that \Nif you gained Kamui,
Dialogue: 99,1:24:42.73,1:24:46.60,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Tokyo's barriers would remain intact.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:49.84,1:24:52.23,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,But the Dragons of Earth awakened.
Dialogue: 99,1:24:53.02,1:24:55.58,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,All the Dragons of Heaven \Nwill vanish from this world,
Dialogue: 99,1:24:55.58,1:24:58.32,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,and every single barrier \Nin Tokyo will crumble.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:03.44,1:25:05.96,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Struggle till your last breath, \NDragon of Heaven.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:06.83,1:25:10.69,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,Sister, this means your \Nprediction was wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:11.91,1:25:15.97,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,The politicians won't look twice at a \Ndreamseer whose predictions are wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:16.40,1:25:18.49,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe, don't tell me you...
Dialogue: 99,1:25:18.86,1:25:21.96,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,That means you'll be free.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:22.50,1:25:27.88,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,And if you're free, I don't care \Nwhat happens to the rest of humanity.
Dialogue: 99,1:25:28.65,1:25:31.81,Dialogue,Kanoe,0,0,0,,As long as you're free...
Dialogue: 99,1:25:37.23,1:25:38.64,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe...
Dialogue: 99,1:25:46.39,1:25:48.20,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Arashi! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 99,1:25:48.59,1:25:49.29,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:25.72,1:26:29.61,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Why? Why did you shield me?
Dialogue: 99,1:26:29.61,1:26:32.37,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,You're my type, missie.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:33.42,1:26:38.80,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,All we've got is living as Dragons \Nof Heaven, fighting, and dying.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:39.60,1:26:46.85,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,So if you ask me, I should at least \Nget to die protecting a pretty girl.
Dialogue: 99,1:26:54.14,1:26:59.72,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,Really, you gotta protect her\N to the end to be a man,
Dialogue: 99,1:27:00.64,1:27:06.30,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,but I can't see your pretty \Nface so good anymore...
Dialogue: 99,1:27:07.60,1:27:15.16,Dialogue,Sorata,0,0,0,,I was gonna ask you how you \Nfeel about me, but...
Dialogue: 99,1:27:18.33,1:27:19.76,Dialogue,Arashi,0,0,0,,Sorata!
Dialogue: 99,1:27:33.66,1:27:35.97,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Now you'll be able \Nto give him your answer.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:39.58,1:27:45.61,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kamui... All the Dragons of Heaven\N are dead but you.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:46.28,1:27:48.41,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did Fuuma kill them?
Dialogue: 99,1:27:53.00,1:27:58.33,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}He who has become the Kamui of Earth no \Nlonger has his old memories or feelings.
Dialogue: 99,1:27:59.42,1:28:02.92,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}He has only the urge \Nto kill the Kamui of Heaven
Dialogue: 99,1:28:03.26,1:28:07.26,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}and destroy Tokyo's barriers.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:30.36,1:28:34.54,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will send you to the final \Nbarrier at Tokyo Tower.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:34.97,1:28:38.83,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please see all that is happening\Nto the conclusion you desire.
Dialogue: 99,1:28:40.57,1:28:41.66,Dialogue,Hinoto,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kanoe...
Dialogue: 99,1:29:21.02,1:29:28.30,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma... You really don't \Nremember Kotori or me?
Dialogue: 99,1:29:28.54,1:29:32.60,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,That girl loved Kamui \Nwith all of her heart.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:32.96,1:29:37.35,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,She was pregnant with the sword \Nonly Kamui can wield in battle.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:38.51,1:29:41.69,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,So I took it out. That is all.
Dialogue: 99,1:29:42.99,1:29:44.18,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma...
Dialogue: 99,1:30:10.55,1:30:13.28,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,All six Dragons of Heaven are dead.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:13.28,1:30:15.42,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,When I kill you, this will be over.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:15.90,1:30:20.12,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma, I came back to Tokyo to protect you.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:32.80,1:30:35.70,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,I didn't come back here to fight you!
Dialogue: 99,1:30:37.75,1:30:41.42,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I am Kamui. Destiny decided that.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:43.43,1:30:47.38,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,From the moment you chose \Nto be a Dragon of Heaven,
Dialogue: 99,1:30:47.38,1:30:50.51,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,my fate was to be a Dragon of Earth.
Dialogue: 99,1:30:51.10,1:30:53.51,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You're Fuuma! You're not me!
Dialogue: 99,1:30:53.86,1:30:55.35,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,I am Kamui!
Dialogue: 99,1:31:01.71,1:31:03.76,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,Man cannot go against fate!
Dialogue: 99,1:31:10.00,1:31:12.50,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,You and I are destined to fight.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:12.97,1:31:16.87,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,And the unnecessary human race \Nwill die. That, too, is fate.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:30.57,1:31:31.85,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 99,1:31:32.66,1:31:35.00,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fate is something we choose for ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,1:32:01.77,1:32:04.67,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma!
Dialogue: 99,1:33:03.68,1:33:06.92,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma... It's you, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:08.97,1:33:12.06,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. You promised, right?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:12.76,1:33:15.94,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}You promised you'd come back\N and protect Kotori.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:16.75,1:33:25.33,Dialogue,Fuma,0,0,0,,{\i1}So I made a promise in exchange. \NIf you protected her, I'd protect you.
Dialogue: 99,1:33:32.79,1:33:34.01,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 99,1:33:34.94,1:33:37.18,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Why did this happen?
Dialogue: 99,1:33:37.18,1:33:38.76,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Answer me...
Dialogue: 99,1:33:44.80,1:33:48.86,Dialogue,Kamui,0,0,0,,Fuuma!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.80,1:37:10.89,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur3\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(0,0)\p1\c&H000000&\clip(0,0,1920,130)\t(177200,0,\clip(0,0,1920,0))}m 0 0 l 1920 0 1920 120 0 120
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.34,1:33:52.50,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Nu mai pot continua de unul singur
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.82,1:34:00.29,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Vânturile timpului sunt mult prea puternice
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.99,1:34:07.71,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Toate această durere...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.38,1:34:16.25,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,credeam că mă voi obișnui cu ea
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.32,1:34:22.98,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,AH... kono mama dakishimete
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.67,1:34:30.25,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,nureta mama no kokoro wo
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.30,1:34:38.53,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,kawari tsuzukeru kono toki ni
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.05,1:34:50.31,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,kawaranai ai ga aru nara
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.91,1:34:54.75,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Oare îmi vei ține inima la pieptul tău?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.75,1:35:02.27,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Acceptă-mi lacrimile
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.07,1:35:14.90,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Inima mea e pe cale să se sfărâme
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.80,1:35:25.45,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,O iubire eternă într-un vis etern
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.45,1:35:33.82,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,afureru omoi dake ga
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.82,1:35:48.49,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,hageshiku setsunaku jikan wo umetsukusu
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.49,1:35:52.25,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Deci spune-mi de ce
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.00,1:36:07.68,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,ALL I SEE IS BLUE IN MY HEART
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.68,1:36:10.71,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,WILL YOU STAY WITH ME
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.82,1:36:19.86,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,kaze ga sugisaru made
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.86,1:36:31.16,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,mata... afuredasu ALL MY TEARS
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.58,1:36:42.23,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,FOREVER LOVE, FOREVER DREAM
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.23,1:36:49.87,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,kono mama soba ni ite
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.87,1:37:05.29,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,yoake ni, furueru, kokoro wo dakishimete
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.29,1:37:09.93,Forever Love TL,,0,0,0,,Așa că rămâi cu mine!

